('P', 'Each of 1,000 synthetic companies was scored once without noise and then ten further times. In each repeat every continuous metric was multiplied by (1 + e), where e ~ N(0, sigma) and sigma ranged from 0% to 30%. Pledge levels, moving-average signals and governance flags were held constant.'),
