('H1', '11. Conclusions, Impact and Future Work'),
('P', 'DhanVeda solves its central engineering problem: it delivers an India-calibrated, rubric-intensive financial analysis at close to zero cost, through a cascade that rarely fails outright. Its scoring layers, however, are more precise than they are reliable. The token engineering is validated, whereas ESG tiers and DV bands shift under small input errors, and no score has yet been tested against market outcomes.'),
